  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InfoStandTrigger
  title: Phones
  body: Phone technology has evolved from early cone-style telephones, where users
    listened through a handheld receiver, to traditional corded phones that improved
    convenience and reliability. The introduction of mobile devices like Nokia phones
    brought portability and communication on the go. Today, modern smartphones such
    as the iPhone 16 combine advanced computing, touch interfaces, and internet connectivity,
    transforming phones into powerful, everyday digital tools.
