  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: feead45352d734d2289ee9a7666c370c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InfoStandTrigger
  title: Jets
  body: "Fighter aircraft have evolved from simple propeller-driven planes to advanced
    stealth machines. Early designs like the Fokker Dr.I relied on pilot skill, while
    WWII aircraft like the P-51 Mustang improved speed and range. The MiG-21 introduced
    the jet age with supersonic flight and missiles. Today\u2019s Su-57 represents
    modern warfare with stealth, sensors, and intelligent systems."
